<article class="env-definition" id="26BF12">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/26BF12">Definition <span data-tag="26BF12">5.4.2.8</span>.</a>kappalltau@$\kappa \ll \tau $ Let $\kappa $ and $\tau $ be regular cardinals. We write $\tau \ll \kappa $ if the following condition is satisfied: for every $\tau _0 < \tau $ and every $\kappa _0 < \kappa $, we have $\kappa _0^{\tau _0} < \kappa $. </p>
